- [Beanz] Wow, I can't even tell you

00:17:19.856 --> 00:17:21.458
how much that means to me.

00:17:21.458 --> 00:17:22.626
I'll get right to it.

00:17:22.626 --> 00:17:25.863
Thank you guys for having
me, but my question is,

00:17:25.863 --> 00:17:30.496
was NASCAR, I'm not really
into that sport personally,

00:17:30.496 --> 00:17:34.946
but I'm wondering how the
needs have changed over time,

00:17:34.946 --> 00:17:36.826
how maybe like some of the challenges

00:17:36.826 --> 00:17:40.206
that y'all faced in the '90s or the 2000s,

00:17:40.206 --> 00:17:42.306
what were they, and
also, what are the needs

00:17:42.306 --> 00:17:44.956
and challenges facing y'all
today, and how they differ?

00:17:44.956 --> 00:17:47.506
- Beanz, real quick, just
'cause I love this stuff,

00:17:48.728 --> 00:17:50.679
what sports, if any, are you into?

00:17:52.146 --> 00:17:54.466
- [Beanz] Basketball, but
really, I'm a musician,

00:17:54.466 --> 00:17:57.956
so I'm not a huge sports head,

00:17:57.956 --> 00:18:01.596
and I'm like really far
from being a NASCAR fan,

00:18:01.596 --> 00:18:05.246
but with much respect, I have
a lot of respect for y'all.

00:18:05.246 --> 00:18:06.306
- That's great.

00:18:06.306 --> 00:18:09.576
And why basketball in a world
where you're so hard music?

00:18:09.576 --> 00:18:13.026
Did you play it, is it your friends?

00:18:13.026 --> 00:18:15.716
I'm just curious of the
mapping of the fandom.

00:18:15.716 --> 00:18:18.959
