00:25:33.356 --> 00:25:35.466
Watching Esports and soccer grow

00:25:35.466 --> 00:25:37.879
reminds us, like I said in the meeting,

00:25:39.236 --> 00:25:41.586
or actually in a prior meeting,

00:25:41.586 --> 00:25:43.766
the heavyweight champion of the world

00:25:43.766 --> 00:25:45.086
was the most famous athlete.

00:25:45.086 --> 00:25:48.569
Horse racer, horses were more
famous that football players.

00:25:51.596 --> 00:25:52.429
