- Josh, it's Gary Vaynerchuk,

00:30:44.419 --> 00:30:46.553
you're on The #AskGaryVee Show.

00:30:46.553 --> 00:30:48.569
- [Josh] Okay, it's
happening, shit, all right.

00:30:48.569 --> 00:30:50.296
Thanks, let's do this.

00:30:50.296 --> 00:30:51.326
What's up, Gary?

00:30:51.326 --> 00:30:54.056
- Things are good, please
say hello to Steve and Jill.

00:30:54.056 --> 00:30:55.516
- [Josh] Hello, Steve and Jill.

